{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上方第一块大标题，金色的“憋着一股气”最醒目；随后中部第二块大标题也会争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他想起从前有人把他当作自己人，短暂高兴，但旧日子似乎已经回不去了。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂高兴，随后发酸、惆怅。\",\n  \"missed\": \"离开后才发现内心空了这一层概括；以及他对离开后是否真的会过得更好的深层疑虑，需要读完第二块大标题才能明确。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块字号相近、都很醒目的大标题争夺主视线\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块大标题里，需要把回忆中的短暂高兴和后来的心酸拼起来\",\n    \"单块大标题较长，内部包含处境、回忆和情绪转折等多层意思\",\n    \"两处小字说明连续堆叠，增加了主次辨认负担\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7da6cba2-6d71-4ac7-bdeb-94c274cc2b48", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012641932426Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.485, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:27:18.422622+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "beccb8214ce8f8df0436b029b58a3f45ed13458f498285262c16b2aac8e56539", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "to